  "details": "The current logo has no spacing between VR and Chat.\n\n1. Launch an avatar project from VRChat Creator Companion/ALCOM with SDK 3.10.5 installed.\n\n2. Open the VRChat SDK Splash Screen (navigate to VRChat SDK → Splash Screen from the title bar).\n\n3. Open the VRChat SDK Control Panel (navigate to VRChat SDK → Show Control Panel), check the Authentication, Content Manager and Settings panels.",
